{"3530380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodbreaker: Labyrinth of the Witch", "steam_appid": 3530380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/2c71090c3d66248fa5ac2c4646177fda.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=202 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark and perilous world of Bloodbreaker: Labyrinth of the Witch; a challenging, gothic roguevania. Play as Ayana Crimson - known as the Bloodbreaker - a day-walking vampire with a taste for demon blood. Blending the best elements of the roguelite and Metroidvania genres, Bloodbreaker aims to deliver an experience that is as rewarding as it is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her brother Matthew is captured by the enigmatic white witch Brendowyn Sangrianon, Ayana must descend into the Labyrinth - a sprawling maze steeped in ancient magic and corruption. In her journey to save her brother, Ayana will uncover the truth about her family's cursed lineage and Matthew's uncontrollable powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/ac820bd9cdca955b35e2583e045b6391.avif?t=1786165400\" width=799 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Labyrinth; brought to life with strikingly haunting gothic visuals and an atmospheric soundtrack. From moonlit courtyards to decaying cathedrals, every area is steeped in corruption and despair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/43b1762af51138127f4ec7c83ebdf022.poster.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/43b1762af51138127f4ec7c83ebdf022.webm?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/e4b1ab2463cc7168b40fb1cc554d7160.webp?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/946e957aa47c16e3bbb297b6170dcbdc.avif?t=1786165400\" width=799 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, responsive combat that encourages players to chain attack combos, dodges and unleash powerful abilities to defeat enemies. Using the Blood Ascension System, upgrade Ayana's stats, unlock new abilities, and refine her combat skills to aid her survival in the Labyrinth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/71dada742202a8d36cd40e3f30489727.poster.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/71dada742202a8d36cd40e3f30489727.webm?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/71dada742202a8d36cd40e3f30489727.mp4?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/e4b1ab2463cc7168b40fb1cc554d7160.webp?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/624515d6d5cd372c12cc98ce79b23f85.avif?t=1786165400\" width=799 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness Ayana's vampiric abilities by consuming weakened enemies to restore Blood Points. Ayana can use these points to heal herself and keep the fight going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/f242fafef1d72fdfaf9424e2fd94c665.poster.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/f242fafef1d72fdfaf9424e2fd94c665.webm?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/f242fafef1d72fdfaf9424e2fd94c665.mp4?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/e4b1ab2463cc7168b40fb1cc554d7160.webp?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/2c71090c3d66248fa5ac2c4646177fda.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=202 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark and perilous world of Bloodbreaker: Labyrinth of the Witch; a challenging, gothic roguevania. Play as Ayana Crimson - known as the Bloodbreaker - a day-walking vampire with a taste for demon blood. Blending the best elements of the roguelite and Metroidvania genres, Bloodbreaker aims to deliver an experience that is as rewarding as it is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her brother Matthew is captured by the enigmatic white witch Brendowyn Sangrianon, Ayana must descend into the Labyrinth - a sprawling maze steeped in ancient magic and corruption. In her journey to save her brother, Ayana will uncover the truth about her family's cursed lineage and Matthew's uncontrollable powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/ac820bd9cdca955b35e2583e045b6391.avif?t=1786165400\" width=799 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Labyrinth; brought to life with strikingly haunting gothic visuals and an atmospheric soundtrack. From moonlit courtyards to decaying cathedrals, every area is steeped in corruption and despair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/43b1762af51138127f4ec7c83ebdf022.poster.avif?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/43b1762af51138127f4ec7c83ebdf022.webm?t=1786165400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/e4b1ab2463cc7168b40fb1cc554d7160.webp?t=1786165400\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530380/extras/946e957aa47c16e3bbb297b6170dcbdc.avif?t=1786165400\" width=799 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, responsive combat tha